  "uncertain": [
    "ICSP labels come from a 2x3 table printed below the header; the table's top row (RST SCK MISO) is assumed to be the header's upper row and its bottom row (GND MOSI VCC) the lower row in the same left-right order",
    "Some table cells are printed in near-white (faded) text: '3.3V' beside IORef, and 'SCL'/'SDA'/'AREF' in the third right column. The faded '3.3V' for IORef was not recorded as a function because it may be intentionally hidden; the faded SCL/SDA/AREF are exact repeats"
  ],
  "notes": "Recorded as printed: right table first column spells 'AREA' for the AREF pin; third column prints 'TX1' for D1 and 'RX1' for D0. Twelve Grove ports (A0-A2, D2-D7, I2C x2, UART), the Li-Po JST and the unlabeled 2x5 SWD header at the bottom have no individually labeled pins and are skipped."
